 ships & pleasure\n💸 money\, worth & talents\n🍀 growth & luck\n🧱 c
 ommitment & effort\n⚡ sudden change\n🌫️ intuition (or confusion)\n
 🌋 deep transformation\n☀️ identity & vitality\n🌑 New Moon: time 
 to begin\n🌕 Full Moon: time to close\n🌘 eclipse & eclipse season\n
 🌟 Venus as morning or evening star\n🌒 shadow before a retrograde\n\n
 Open each event to read your personal interpretation. At the end you'll fi
 nd the technical detail\, in case you want to learn.\n\n—\n✨ A product
