DESCRIPTION:Since 2023 you've been in a long process of questioning your i
 dentity and how you show up in your closest relationships (house 7). Right
  now\, with transiting people and groups (house 11) blurring old certainti
 es\, that fog gets thicker: who are you when no one else defines you? This
  isn't confusion for nothing — it's dissolving an old sense of self that
  leaned too much on partnership to feel whole. Let it be unclear for a whi
 le\; clarity comes later\, not now. → What part of your identity have yo
 u outsourced to others?\n\n— Technical detail: Neptune within orb of squ
 are your Sun natal (house 7) · peak · exact: 28/04/26\, 19/09/26\, 28/02
 /27\n\n(until Feb 8\, 2028)\n\n—\n✨ A product created by Soul Friendly
 \n🕒 Last updated: 29 Sep 2026 · 22:36\nhttps://mi-calendario-astral.ne
 tlify.app
