DESCRIPTION:This long thread has been shaking up a deep\, private wound (h
 ouse 12) tied to Chiron — something about feeling out of place or not fu
 lly seen since childhood. Now the energy is settling: the sudden insights 
 and unexpected shifts of the past months are integrating. You don't need a
  dramatic breakthrough anymore\, just quiet acknowledgment of how far you'
 ve come in accepting that old pain. → What have you finally stopped hidi
 ng\, even from yourself?\n\n— Technical detail: Uranus within orb of con
 junction your Chiron natal (house 12) · separating · exact: 11/06/25\, 0
 9/12/25\, 30/03/26\n\n(until Jul 21\, 2027)\n\n—\n✨ A product created 
